From fb5d20f866b1ccbfdf28acdc7e37dc04d6798856 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:04:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(api-mode): cross-tab lock around refresh/resume

The API revokes a session whose rotated refresh token is used twice, so two tabs refreshing at the same moment could sign the
person out. Refresh and resume now run under a Web Locks lock and read the refresh token inside it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AfTmFoA3hZx1abuSoduadP
